ion findings are shown below."]},{"sid":47596,"type":"labs","lines":["A KOH preparation of a skin scraping demonstrates both hyphae and spores described as having a \u201cspaghetti and meatballs\u201d appearance."]}],"orders":[]},{"id":11178,"date":"2021-01-15","type":"outpatient","dept":"Dermatology","attending":"Dr. Sarah Chen","cc":"Rash slowly spreading over the past few weeks after returning from a beach vacation","order":1,"method":"hybrid","question_ids":[4747],"sections":[{"sid":47597,"type":"chief_complaint","lines":["Rash slowly spreading over the past few weeks after returning from a beach vacation"]},{"sid":47598,"type":"hpi","lines":["The patient returns to the dermatology clinic approximately one year after his prior presentation for progressive skin discoloration on his back, now presenting with similar concerns.","He recently returned from a beach vacation and noticed the lesions after spending several days in the sun.","He denies any itching, pain, or burning, and says the rash is more noticeable after tanning.","The lesions are scattered over his upper chest and back and appear as multiple small, oval macules with slightly raised edges.","On closer inspection, the areas are hypopigmented compared to the surrounding skin.","He says he tried scrubbing in the shower, but the discoloration has not improved.","The rash does not involve his hands, feet, groin, or face."]},{"sid":47599,"type":"pmh","lines":["Active Problem List:","- Tinea versicolor (diagnosed 2020-01-15)","","He is otherwise healthy."]},{"sid":47600,"type":"psh","lines":["- Wisdom teeth extraction age 18"]},{"sid":47601,"type":"medications","lines":["He takes no medications"]},{"sid":47602,"type":"allergies","lines":["NKDA"]},{"sid":47603,"type":"family_history","lines":["- No significant family history of skin disorders or atopic disease"]},{"sid":47604,"type":"social_history","lines":["He is sexually active with one partner and uses condoms consistently."]},{"sid":47605,"type":"ros","l